M=1000, per_test_Pfa=0.0001 => familywise_Pfa=0.09516711
For familywise_alpha=0.001: exact_threshold_energy=13.815011, Bonferroni_threshold_energy=13.815511 (Exp(1) null score)
NOTE: receiver hypotheses/windows are correlated in practice; calibrate actual event-level false completions on null/noise streams, including repeated windows and final framing checks.
